notes.content:
08.07.2021
New update: 1.1.0

- [b]FOODBALL mode[/b] - football match mode with 2 teams which are trying to score goal by hitting the ball by shooting with rifle, as well as killing each other to eliminate players. The most fun mode where 1x1, 2x2, 3x3 and 4x4 team battles;
- [b]Bug fixes[/b] - some minor bug fixes;
- [b]Color correction[/b] - optimization of in-game colors;
- [b]Servers[/b] - added global server choice section. For best experience choose your local servers, but due to the new release of the game, some servers can be empty until global audience will start to play. We recommend to choose "General server" for a short time period (some ping and lag may occur), then to change to your local servers.
